# ^ Native dirs are generated by `expo prebuild` from app.config.ts, which is the
#   source of truth. Committing dirs generated on a machine that cannot compile
#   them yields a repo that only builds on one laptop. Revisit (with an ADR) only
#   when hand-written native code is genuinely required.

